  "notes": [
    "visit_FromImport (src/jinja2/compiler.py:1126, review reason no_reference) is never called or referenced by name: NodeVisitor.visit dispatches on the node class with getattr(self, f'visit_{type(node).__name__}') (visitor.py:33), so it runs for every {% from ... import %} node while CodeGenerator walks a template (compiler.generate builds the generator and calls generator.visit(node), compiler.py:117; visit_Template then visits the body). Every template compile reaches compiler.generate: Environment.compile (environment.py:729) -> _generate (:679, return generate(...) at :691); from_string (:1089) calls self.compile (:1108); get_template (:979) and select_template (:1016) go through _load_template (:954) -> self.loader.load (:972) -> BaseLoader.load -> environment.compile (loaders.py:138); get_or_select_template (:1070) calls get_template / select_template; compile_templates calls self.compile (:879); Template.__new__ calls env.from_string (:1211). The sandbox classes subclass Environment and inherit all of these; the bug is in generated code, so it applies sandbox or not. Checked against the record's tree 48b0687 (3.1.4-57-g48b0687e, first parent of the fix) on 2026-11-04."
  ],
